  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "** Long Answer - 5 Marks**\n\nPrimality TestWrite a program to check whether a given number is prime or not.\n\n\nIf the number is a **prime number**, print **\"yes\"**.\nIf the number is **not a prime number**, print **\"no\"**.\n**Note:**\n\n\nThe number **1 is not a prime number**.",
    "constraints": [
      "1 **≤** **n** **≤** 100000"
    ],
